{"id":"0d350807688805b1","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-generated-closed-set.md","title":"Fixed Point and Generated Closed Set","display":"df-generated-closed-set — Fixed Point and Generated Closed Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-generated-closed-set","aliases":["18-df-generated-closed-set","18-df-070"],"display":"df-generated-closed-set — Fixed Point and Generated Closed Set","depends_on":["[[18-df-fixed-point-set]]","[[18-df-nonmonotone-stages]]"],"source_work":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)","source_section":"Definition 13.1.1; Lemma 13.1.2; equation (13.1)","source_printed_pages":"333–334","source_pdf_pages":"341–342","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_review":"未逐项复核原书证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-generated-closed-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-generated-closed-set</span><span>18-df-070</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-generated-closed-set — Fixed Point and Generated Closed Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"779baa2ce0d8c0d8\" href=\"?note=779baa2ce0d8c0d8\" title=\"18-df-fixed-point-set\">18-df-fixed-point-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1617e481ba305017\" href=\"?note=1617e481ba305017\" title=\"18-df-nonmonotone-stages\">18-df-nonmonotone-stages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_work","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Definition 13.1.1; Lemma 13.1.2; equation (13.1)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"333–334"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"341–342"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_review","html":"未逐项复核原书证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\">\\(\\Gamma:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(S\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fix}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fix}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"779baa2ce0d8c0d8\" href=\"?note=779baa2ce0d8c0d8\" title=\"18-df-fixed-point-set\">18-df-fixed-point-set</a> 中作用于自映射的固定点集合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^+(S)\">\\(\\Gamma^+(S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^{&lt;\\infty}\">\\(\\Gamma^{&lt;\\infty}\\)</span> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1617e481ba305017\" href=\"?note=1617e481ba305017\" title=\"18-df-nonmonotone-stages\">18-df-nonmonotone-stages</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathrm{Fix}(\\Gamma)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\Gamma(S)=S.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\in\\mathrm{Fix}(\\Gamma)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\Gamma(S)=S.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathrm{Fix}(\\Gamma^+)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\Gamma(S)\\subseteq S,\n\\qquad\n\\Gamma^{&lt;\\infty}\\in\\mathrm{Fix}(\\Gamma^+).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\in\\mathrm{Fix}(\\Gamma^+)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\Gamma(S)\\subseteq S,\n\\qquad\n\\Gamma^{&lt;\\infty}\\in\\mathrm{Fix}(\\Gamma^+).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一式保留一般固定点定义；后两式区分原算子固定点与其膨胀版本的固定点。原书 Definition 13.1.1 称 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^{&lt;\\infty}\">\\(\\Gamma^{&lt;\\infty}\\)</span> 为“由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 生成的固定点”，并明确它是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^+\">\\(\\Gamma^+\\)</span> 的固定点。若没有单调性，不能据此断言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma(\\Gamma^{&lt;\\infty})=\\Gamma^{&lt;\\infty}\">\\(\\Gamma(\\Gamma^{&lt;\\infty})=\\Gamma^{&lt;\\infty}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>见证：令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma(\\varnothing)=\\{0\\}\">\\(\\Gamma(\\varnothing)=\\{0\\}\\)</span> 且对非空 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma(S)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Gamma(S)=\\varnothing\\)</span>，累积过程停于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0\\}\">\\(\\{0\\}\\)</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma(\\{0\\})=\\varnothing\\ne\\{0\\}\">\\(\\Gamma(\\{0\\})=\\varnothing\\ne\\{0\\}\\)</span>。前两个等价式按定义展开，最后式由上游停滞证明得到。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-fixed-point-set","status":"resolved","id":"779baa2ce0d8c0d8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-fixed-point-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-nonmonotone-stages","status":"resolved","id":"1617e481ba305017","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-nonmonotone-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-fixed-point-set","status":"resolved","id":"779baa2ce0d8c0d8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)$，$S\\subseteq\\omega$；$\\mathrm{Fix}$ 是 [[18-df-fixed-point-set]] 中作用于自映射的固定点集合。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-nonmonotone-stages","status":"resolved","id":"1617e481ba305017","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma^+(S)$、$\\Gamma^{<\\infty}$ 按 [[18-df-nonmonotone-stages]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fix}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma^+(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma^{<\\infty}","display":false},{"tex":"S\\in\\mathrm{Fix}(\\Gamma)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\Gamma(S)=S.","display":true},{"tex":"S\\in\\mathrm{Fix}(\\Gamma^+)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\Gamma(S)\\subseteq S,\n\\qquad\n\\Gamma^{<\\infty}\\in\\mathrm{Fix}(\\Gamma^+).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma^{<\\infty}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma(\\Gamma^{<\\infty})=\\Gamma^{<\\infty}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma(\\varnothing)=\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma(S)=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma(\\{0\\})=\\varnothing\\ne\\{0\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1780,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-136","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-generated-closed-set]]"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-71","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-generated-closed-set]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-generated-closed-set]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-generated-closed-set|18-df-generated-closed-set]]"},{"id":"09f8f6fb03023072","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-generated-closed-set|18-df-generated-closed-set]]"}],"outgoing":["779baa2ce0d8c0d8","1617e481ba305017"]}